T3 non-Avana and state-modifier comparisons and pending TMED10 probes. All conclusions remain associations in the supplied dataset, not proof of causality, pathway mechanism, or external generalizability; molecular co-occurrence, library/Cas9 missingness, subgroup selection, and multiple testing remain cautions.",
